  0.000000000   5.190163774   0.000000000
  0.000000000   0.000000000   5.190163774

ATOMIC_POSITIONS (crystal)
  K   0.0000000  0.0000000  0.0000000
  Ni  0.5000000  0.5000000  0.5000000
  I   0.5000000  0.5000000  0.0000000
  I   0.5000000  0.0000000  0.5000000
  I   0.0000000  0.5000000  0.5000000

K_POINTS automatic
